+      perm       : fixed permutation from SAMP_RANK_PERM (stream swap)
+      docs       : greedily give the doc-richest bin to the rank with the fewest
+                   cumulative docs so far (equalise cumulative doc counts)
+      tokens     : same, but equalising cumulative packed tokens
